{"4266270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One, Two, Death", "steam_appid": 4266270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE, TWO, DEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mansion with one other person.<br>The only thing you know is that <strong>you must escape</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you team up with your friend, solve the mysteries together, and survive side by side?<br>Or will you lead your friend to their death and choose your own freedom instead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>sadistic creature</strong> watches your every move, taking pleasure in your fear, your mistakes, and your pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔪 <strong>Every choice matters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266270/extras/d6c68d5012f6a7eeda6785c303937fee.poster.avif?t=1772614604\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266270/extras/d6c68d5012f6a7eeda6785c303937fee.webm?t=1772614604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266270/extras/d6c68d5012f6a7eeda6785c303937fee.mp4?t=1772614604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>🩸 <strong>Trust or betrayal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266270/extras/70a27b81fc4cb534f03f61c7bf3b492a.poster.avif?t=1772614604\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266270/extras/70a27b81fc4cb534f03f61c7bf3b492a.webm?t=1772614604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it